window.BLAND=[["^humerus$", "Proximal: head, greater tubercle, lesser tubercle, intertubercular sulcus (bicipital groove), deltoid tuberosity. Distal: capitulum, trochlea, olecranon fossa, medial and lateral supracondylar ridges, medial and lateral epicondyles", ""], ["^scapula$", "Supraspinous fossa, infraspinous fossa, spine, acromion process, coracoid process, medial border, lateral border, inferior angle, glenoid fossa", "The glenoid fossa is deepened by the glenoid labrum, a rim of fibrocartilage. The glenohumeral joint is a shallow ball and socket: the most movable joint in the body, at the expense of stability."], ["^clavicle$", "Acromial end, sternal end, conoid tubercle", "S-shaped: convex along the medial two-thirds, concave along the lateral third. The only bony attachment of the arm to the axial skeleton (at the SC joint); acts as a strut so the arm swings clear of the trunk."], ["^ulna$", "Olecranon process, trochlear notch, coronoid process, ulnar tuberosity, radial notch, styloid process", "The ulna stays fixed while the radius rotates around it in pronation and supination. The annular ligament wraps the radial head to the radial notch."], ["^radius$", "Radial head, radial tuberosity, styloid process, ulnar notch", "Rotates around the ulna in pronation and supination; the concave shaft gives clearance for the radial tuberosity."], ["^scaphoid$", "", "Also called the navicular; the most commonly fractured carpal. Proximal row."], ["^lunate$", "", "Proximal row."], ["^triquetral$", "", "Also called the triquetrum. Proximal row."], ["^pisiform$", "", "A sesamoid bone in the tendon of flexor carpi ulnaris. Proximal row."], ["^trapezium$", "", "Distal row. Forms the saddle-shaped 1st CMC joint with the 1st metacarpal."], ["^trapezoid$", "", "Distal row. Joins the 2nd metacarpal."], ["^capitate$", "", "Distal row. Joins the 3rd metacarpal."], ["^hamate$", "Hook of hamate", "Distal row. Joins the 4th (and 5th) metacarpal."], ["^first metacarpal", "", "Two small sesamoid bones on the palm side of its far end improve the line of pull for flexor pollicis brevis, abductor pollicis brevis and adductor pollicis."], ["metacarpal", "", "CMC joints: 1st with the trapezium (saddle joint), 2nd with the trapezoid, 3rd with the capitate, 4th with the hamate."], ["phalanx of (thumb|index|middle finger|ring finger|little finger)", "Proximal, middle and distal phalanges (the thumb has no middle phalanx)", "Joints: MCP between metacarpal and proximal phalanx; PIP and DIP between the phalanges."]].map(x=>[new RegExp(x[0]),x[1],x[2]]);
